        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>점증모형</choice_text>
          <commentary>점증모형은 기존 정책의 점진적 수정이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>혼합모형</choice_text>
          <commentary>혼합모형은 합리모형과 점증모형의 결합이다.</commentary>
